                         <textLang mainLang="gez"/>
                                <note>The Vita of a possibly unknown saint, ʾābuna Dānǝʾel, who was born in <placeName ref="LOC6195Wambar">Manbartā</placeName>, 
                               from the children of ʾAfkārā who was called Lāʿǝlāy Mogāryā. He is said to have died 
                               on 6 Ḫǝdār, in the age of 84, and been buried in the monastery.</note>
